    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="cbfb262f-200d-53a6-99e7-9703592880fe" activityNameId="4da82789-bab1-5692-997e-56c1a5b29011" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Iron ore, 65% Fe, at beneficiation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Iron ore, 65% Fe, at beneficiation
This ore has different grain sizes. It can be lump ore that can be used directly in the blast furnace or it can be ore of smaller grain size that is used for sinter and pellet production. Water emissions are estimated according to the maximal levels for financial support of mining activities by the world bank.;
UUID: c806993a-0dd6-366f-8aac-68f113941bf1
Milling and sorting of crude ore.
Location: Data relate to the global average
Technology: Milling and mechanical sorting. Average iron yield is 84%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 6.14E11 kg/a
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c806993a-0dd6-366f-8aac-68f113941bf1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
